# taskforge-api-client — EAV port (apps/taskforge-api-client, semsc v0.1).
#
# FULL 1:1 port of the single-operation async outbound client: build three
# HttpGetRequest values (a shared HttpRequestPolicy + each URL), START all three
# net.fetchText calls before awaiting any (the original's async-shape invariant),
# print the "started" line, then for each fetch join the result, read its body
# (HttpTextResponse.body), print the section label + body, and release the body
# copy (net.freeTextBody). Every fetch is a `task` (EAV async = start/join,
# README §13) converted against sigs/standard.net.semsig.
#
# Network execution is native HTTP-only today: net.fetchText lowers through the
# ss_net runtime, and HTTPS/TLS is rejected until a TLS backend lands. The record
# construction (HttpRequestPolicy.new / HttpGetRequest.new) and field access
# (HttpTextResponse.body) are real EAV record ops. The whole app parses + lints
# clean as `target console`. (X-041)
#
# Conversions / language differences: the original's `new` + `fieldSet` builder
# becomes immutable `Record.new` construction; the wait-set
# `await … case … done` (await-any in completion order) becomes start-all then
# join-each in document order (EAV has no select/wait-set); per-call
# `timeout`/`cancelOn`, the Result/MainError return, and the console.writeLine
# error path are dropped (EAV tasks carry no cancel token, a console entry
# returns ExitCode, and console.writeLine is void).


appTaskforgeApiClient is module
appTaskforgeApiClient path apps.taskforgeApiClient
appTaskforgeApiClient exports main
appTaskforgeApiClient purpose "Call the running TaskForge server through standard.net and print the responses"
appTaskforgeApiClient invariant "Every outbound fetch is started before the first response is awaited"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32
ExitCode purpose "Process exit status"

Url is alias
Url for String
Url purpose "An absolute http:// URL to fetch with the current native client"

HttpClientBodyText is alias
HttpClientBodyText for String
HttpClientBodyText purpose "A heap-owned response body copy, released by net.freeTextBody"

NetworkTimeoutMilliseconds is alias
NetworkTimeoutMilliseconds for Int64
NetworkTimeoutMilliseconds purpose "A per-request timeout budget in milliseconds"

ResponseBodyLimitBytes is alias
ResponseBodyLimitBytes for Int64
ResponseBodyLimitBytes purpose "The maximum response body size accepted, in bytes"

HttpRedirectLimit is alias
HttpRedirectLimit for Int64
HttpRedirectLimit purpose "The maximum number of redirects followed"

HttpRequestPolicy is record
HttpRequestPolicy field timeoutMillis NetworkTimeoutMilliseconds
HttpRequestPolicy field maxBodyBytes ResponseBodyLimitBytes
HttpRequestPolicy field redirectLimit HttpRedirectLimit
HttpRequestPolicy purpose "Per-request transport policy (timeout, body limit, redirect limit)"

HttpGetRequest is record
HttpGetRequest field url Url
HttpGetRequest field policy HttpRequestPolicy
HttpGetRequest purpose "An outbound GET request: a URL plus its transport policy"

HttpTextResponse is record
HttpTextResponse field body HttpClientBodyText
HttpTextResponse purpose "A fetched text response carrying the heap-owned body copy"

outboundFetch is capability
outboundFetch grants write network.http.client
outboundFetch grants connect net.http.127.0.0.1
outboundFetch purpose "Authority to perform outbound HTTP client work through standard.net"
outboundFetch rationale "Test harness client intentionally targets the local TaskForge loopback server"

consoleStdoutWriteCapability is capability
consoleStdoutWriteCapability grants write console.stdout
consoleStdoutWriteCapability purpose "Authority to print probe progress and response bodies to stdout"

fetchBodyHeapRelease is capability
fetchBodyHeapRelease grants free heap
fetchBodyHeapRelease purpose "Authority to release HttpTextResponse body copies returned by net.fetchText"

taskForgeHealthUrl is storage module immutable Url "http://127.0.0.1:18090/health"
taskForgeVersionUrl is storage module immutable Url "http://127.0.0.1:18090/api/version"
taskForgeTodosUrl is storage module immutable Url "http://127.0.0.1:18090/api/todos"
timeoutMillis is storage module immutable NetworkTimeoutMilliseconds 3000
maxBodyBytes is storage module immutable ResponseBodyLimitBytes 1048576
redirectLimit is storage module immutable HttpRedirectLimit 5
successfulExitCode is storage module immutable ExitCode 0
startedText is storage module immutable String "started TaskForge fetches before awaiting"
healthLabelText is storage module immutable String "TaskForge /health response:"
versionLabelText is storage module immutable String "TaskForge /api/version response:"
todosLabelText is storage module immutable String "TaskForge /api/todos unauthenticated response:"

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write network.http.client
main effect write console.stdout
main effect free heap
main uses outboundFetch
main uses consoleStdoutWriteCapability
main uses fetchBodyHeapRelease
main memory heap yes
main async yes
main purpose "Start three outbound GETs against the TaskForge server, then print responses in order"
main invariant "All three fetches are started before the first await (the async client shape)"
main do buildRequestPolicy
main do buildHealthRequest
main do buildVersionRequest
main do buildTodosRequest
main start healthFetchTask
main start versionFetchTask
main start todosFetchTask
main do writeStartedLine
main join healthFetchTask
main do readHealthBody
main do writeHealthLabel
main do writeHealthBody
main do releaseHealthBody
main join versionFetchTask
main do readVersionBody
main do writeVersionLabel
main do writeVersionBody
main do releaseVersionBody
main join todosFetchTask
main do readTodosBody
main do writeTodosLabel
main do writeTodosBody
main do releaseTodosBody
main return successfulExitCode

buildRequestPolicy is call
buildRequestPolicy in main
buildRequestPolicy invokes HttpRequestPolicy.new
buildRequestPolicy arg timeoutMillis NetworkTimeoutMilliseconds timeoutMillis
buildRequestPolicy arg maxBodyBytes ResponseBodyLimitBytes maxBodyBytes
buildRequestPolicy arg redirectLimit HttpRedirectLimit redirectLimit
buildRequestPolicy out requestPolicy HttpRequestPolicy

buildHealthRequest is call
buildHealthRequest in main
buildHealthRequest invokes HttpGetRequest.new
buildHealthRequest arg url Url taskForgeHealthUrl
buildHealthRequest arg policy HttpRequestPolicy requestPolicy
buildHealthRequest out healthRequest HttpGetRequest

buildVersionRequest is call
buildVersionRequest in main
buildVersionRequest invokes HttpGetRequest.new
buildVersionRequest arg url Url taskForgeVersionUrl
buildVersionRequest arg policy HttpRequestPolicy requestPolicy
buildVersionRequest out versionRequest HttpGetRequest

buildTodosRequest is call
buildTodosRequest in main
buildTodosRequest invokes HttpGetRequest.new
buildTodosRequest arg url Url taskForgeTodosUrl
buildTodosRequest arg policy HttpRequestPolicy requestPolicy
buildTodosRequest out todosRequest HttpGetRequest

healthFetchTask is task
healthFetchTask in main
healthFetchTask invokes net.fetchText
healthFetchTask arg request HttpGetRequest healthRequest
healthFetchTask out healthResponse HttpTextResponse

versionFetchTask is task
versionFetchTask in main
versionFetchTask invokes net.fetchText
versionFetchTask arg request HttpGetRequest versionRequest
versionFetchTask out versionResponse HttpTextResponse

todosFetchTask is task
todosFetchTask in main
todosFetchTask invokes net.fetchText
todosFetchTask arg request HttpGetRequest todosRequest
todosFetchTask out todosResponse HttpTextResponse

writeStartedLine is call
writeStartedLine in main
writeStartedLine invokes console.writeLine
writeStartedLine arg text String startedText

readHealthBody is call
readHealthBody in main
readHealthBody invokes HttpTextResponse.body
readHealthBody arg record HttpTextResponse healthResponse
readHealthBody out healthBody HttpClientBodyText

writeHealthLabel is call
writeHealthLabel in main
writeHealthLabel invokes console.writeLine
writeHealthLabel arg text String healthLabelText

writeHealthBody is call
writeHealthBody in main
writeHealthBody invokes console.writeLine
writeHealthBody arg text String healthBody

releaseHealthBody is call
releaseHealthBody in main
releaseHealthBody invokes net.freeTextBody
releaseHealthBody arg body HttpClientBodyText healthBody
releaseHealthBody discards "the free status is not part of the exit code"

readVersionBody is call
readVersionBody in main
readVersionBody invokes HttpTextResponse.body
readVersionBody arg record HttpTextResponse versionResponse
readVersionBody out versionBody HttpClientBodyText

writeVersionLabel is call
writeVersionLabel in main
writeVersionLabel invokes console.writeLine
writeVersionLabel arg text String versionLabelText

writeVersionBody is call
writeVersionBody in main
writeVersionBody invokes console.writeLine
writeVersionBody arg text String versionBody

releaseVersionBody is call
releaseVersionBody in main
releaseVersionBody invokes net.freeTextBody
releaseVersionBody arg body HttpClientBodyText versionBody
releaseVersionBody discards "the free status is not part of the exit code"

readTodosBody is call
readTodosBody in main
readTodosBody invokes HttpTextResponse.body
readTodosBody arg record HttpTextResponse todosResponse
readTodosBody out todosBody HttpClientBodyText

writeTodosLabel is call
writeTodosLabel in main
writeTodosLabel invokes console.writeLine
writeTodosLabel arg text String todosLabelText

writeTodosBody is call
writeTodosBody in main
writeTodosBody invokes console.writeLine
writeTodosBody arg text String todosBody

releaseTodosBody is call
releaseTodosBody in main
releaseTodosBody invokes net.freeTextBody
releaseTodosBody arg body HttpClientBodyText todosBody
releaseTodosBody discards "the free status is not part of the exit code"
